        "content": "This dashboard covers **metrics Prometheus already scrapes**. Audit records, health for operators, and dead letters stay in the product — they are not a second Grafana app.\n\n本看板只覆盖 **Prometheus 已抓取的指标**。审计、运营健康检查与死信仍在产品内查看，不是再做一套 Grafana 应用。\n\n- **Health / 健康:** authenticated `GET /admin/health` (same liveness/readiness states). Probes stay on the management port: `GET /actuator/health/liveness` and `/readiness` (platform-app 8089, entry-gateway 8090, sample-consumer 8091).\n- **Audit query / 审计查询:** console `/audit`, `GET /api/v1/audit`.\n- **Audit export / NDJSON (WP9-1) / 审计导出:** `POST /api/v1/audit/export` (permission `audit.export`). Optional file/stdout sink: `platform.audit.sink.enabled` (default off). Schema: `docs/observability/audit-ndjson-schema.md`.\n- **Dead letters / 死信:** console `/dead-letters`.\n- **Logs / 日志:** stdout pattern includes `correlationId` and `traceId`. Match those with `X-Correlation-Id` / `traceparent` on the request.\n\nScrape and import notes: `deploy/observability/README.md`. This file is not a production deploy, and it does not require Grafana Cloud.\n\n抓取与导入说明见上文 README。本文件不是一次生产发布，也不需要 Grafana Cloud。\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
